  "name": "Old Tarkov Movement (No Inertia)",
  "slug": "old-tarkov-movement-no-inertia",
  "teaser": "Completely removes any inertia and slowed down movement, and replaces it with the official much faster movement from Tarkov 12.10 3.9 Version in comments",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2512.png",
  "downloads": 123079,
  "favourites_count": 87,
  "description": "<h1>Old Tarkov Movement</h1>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Info</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><blockquote>\n<p>This mod restores the movement from Tarkov in <strong>2021</strong>. It <strong>completely removes</strong> the modern movement that has <strong>inertia</strong>, and other hidden values <strong>that made the game way slower</strong>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"WuX0DidY3aA\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/WuX0DidY3aA?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WuX0DidY3aA/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><em>It will only ask you to replace if you are reinstalling the mod.</em></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/TheBoogle/OldTarkovMovement/blob/main/installation23.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"installation\" /></p></div></div></div>\n",
